      "description": "Late bounds check. In the escape branch, the code dereferences `p` before testing `if (p >= chunk->end)`. When the input ends with a lone backslash, `ucl_chunk_skipc()` makes `p == chunk->end`, so this read goes out of bounds. The fix moves the guard before `c = *p`."
